---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Base title={`About | ${SITE_NAME}`} description={`About ${SITE_NAME}: clear programming steps for every garage door opener, remote, keypad and car.`}>
  <section>
    <h1>About {SITE_NAME}</h1>
    <p>Programming a garage door remote should take a minute, but the instructions are scattered across hundreds of manuals and support pages. We collect them in one place, sorted by opener model and Learn button colour, and rewrite them as short, clear steps.</p>
    <p>We're independent. We're not affiliated with Chamberlain Group (LiftMaster, Chamberlain, Craftsman), Genie, Overhead Door, HomeLink or any carmaker. Brand names are used only to describe compatibility.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
